morphe-autodetach
Copyright 2026 aaronmurniadi

This module bundles the detach engine from zygisk-detach.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored component: zygisk-detach
Source:      https://github.com/j-hc/zygisk-detach
Author:      j-hc (https://github.com/j-hc)
License:     Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE-Apache-2.0)
Version:     pinned in build.sh as ZD_VERSION
Files:       zygisk/<abi>.so      Zygisk hook injected into com.android.vending
             bin/<arch>/detach    CLI that serializes the package list
             bin/<arch>/ksu_profile

The bundled binaries are not modified. They are copied from the official
zygisk-detach release zip at build time and packed into this module.

What this module adds:
  - Detection of Morphe root-mount modules (/data/adb/modules/*-morphe)
  - List merge with detach.txt and skip.txt
  - Serialization and install of the engine list on install and on every boot
  - Zygisk and conflict checks in the installer

